<p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>

<p><strong>Welcome to PlanetTalk — your individual partner account is active.</strong></p>

<p>Thank you for verifying your email. You can now earn commission when customers use your partner code. Here are your details:</p>

<div style="background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #24B6C3;">
    <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Partner code:</strong> {{agentCode}}</p>
    <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Commission rate:</strong> {{commissionRate}}%</p>
    <p style="margin: 8px 0;"><strong>Sign in with:</strong> {{email}}</p>
</div>

<h3>Your onboarding checklist</h3>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0;">
    <li style="margin: 8px 0;">1️⃣ Log in at <a href="{{loginUrl}}" style="color: #24B6C3;">{{loginUrl}}</a></li>
    <li style="margin: 8px 0;">2️⃣ Complete your profile</li>
    <li style="margin: 8px 0;">3️⃣ Share your partner code with your network</li>
    <li style="margin: 8px 0;">4️⃣ Track earnings in your dashboard</li>
</ul>

{{#if minimumPayout}}
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;">Minimum payout: {{minimumPayout}} · {{payoutProcessing}}</p>
{{/if}}

<p>Need help? <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #24B6C3;">{{supportEmail}}</a></p>

<p>Cheers,<br><strong>The PlanetTalk Partner Team</strong></p>

<div class="info-box warning" style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 14px;">
    <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Security:</strong> Keep your login details. Report anything suspicious.</p>
</div>
